00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:40.875
it wasn't even
that hot of a take.

00:02:40.875 --> 00:02:42.750
- No.
- But, boy, have they fallen off.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.375
- No, how dare I have faith in
Blake Bortles and that offense.

00:02:45.375 --> 00:02:46.667
- Seriously.
- What was I thinking?

00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:47.875
- You're gonna stand
for anything.

00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:49.333
You should've known that was coming.
- Right? I know, I know.

00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:51.125
They have totally fallen off.
Thanks for giving me the pardon.

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:53.542
- Would you pardon yourself?
- Yeah, I would pardon myself.

00:02:53.542 --> 00:02:55.583
I would. Yes, I would.
Thank you.

00:02:55.583 --> 00:02:57.333
Can't be right
about everything.

00:02:57.333 --> 00:02:59.958
- You can't. Blake Bortles is not
really a meaningless debate.

00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:01.625
We know what side you're on.
- Yeah.

00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:03.500
But we've been having
a meaningless debate

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.250
