to your Thanksgiving dinner.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:12.333
It's about sides, and we had
to ask Landon Collins

00:03:12.333 --> 00:03:15.292
"Mac and cheese
or mashed potatoes?"

00:03:15.292 --> 00:03:17.458
- Dun-dun-dun!

00:03:19.417 --> 00:03:21.917
Mac and cheese
or mashed potatoes?

00:03:21.917 --> 00:03:23.583
I'm gonna go to Simms first.

00:03:23.583 --> 00:03:26.042
- Well, it's mashed
potatoes for me.

00:03:26.042 --> 00:03:27.417
