- It is.

00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:36.375
- Do you even have mashed potatoes
at Thanksgiving? Be honest.

00:03:36.375 --> 00:03:38.208
- Not that I recall.
- Not even at the table?

00:03:38.208 --> 00:03:39.958
- I don't think so.

00:03:39.958 --> 00:03:41.792
- Do you ever have mac and cheese
at your Thanksgiving table?

00:03:41.792 --> 00:03:44.458
- Not really.
- I'm fascinated by this

00:03:44.458 --> 00:03:46.958
because I love mac and cheese

00:03:46.958 --> 00:03:51.083
but to me, Thanksgiving
with the turkey and the gravy

00:03:51.083 --> 00:03:52.750
on top of the mashed potatoes

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.000
I couldn't fathom
it not being at a table.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.375
- I agree.
- Correct, correct.

00:03:56.375 --> 00:03:58.042
- But what do you think?
- I feel that. I feel that.

00:03:58.042 --> 00:03:59.875
I like that combination
of how you did that

00:03:59.875 --> 00:04:02.000
but mac and cheese
has to be there.
- OK.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.583
