and cheese, would you be upset?

00:04:08.833 --> 00:04:10.167
- No, I wouldn't be upset.

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:11.875
That's just how you have
your household

00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:13.333
cuz if you came to my house

00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:14.833
we wouldn't have
mashed potatoes.

00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:17.083
- Right.
Do you like mashed potatoes?

00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:18.542
- Yeah, I love mashed potatoes.
- OK.

00:04:18.542 --> 00:04:21.250
- Would you be upset?
- A little.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:23.333
- I think I would too.
- Would it show?

00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:24.458
Would y'all show
your aggression?

00:04:24.458 --> 00:04:25.792
- I would, like, pause.

00:04:25.792 --> 00:04:28.167
Like, I'd be scooping—
I'd be like

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:29.958
"Green beans?

00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:31.000
All right, fine."

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.542
- I have no filter, Landon.

00:04:32.542 --> 00:04:34.917
I'd be, like, to your whole
family—I'd be like

00:04:34.917 --> 00:04:37.292
"No mashed potatoes?
What's goin' on here?"

00:04:37.292 --> 00:04:38.750
Like, I'd say it with love.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.917
- Mac and cheese gotta be there.

00:04:41.917 --> 00:04:43.208
- I'm Stefon Diggs

00:04:43.208 --> 00:04:45.125
